user.description:
Integrations found on your Home Assistant:

- Battery — ha-zendure-solarflow-local (required, ≥ {battery_min}): {battery_found}
- Solar forecast (required): {solar_found}
- Tariffs — ha-tarifs-electricite (recommended, ≥ {tariff_min}): {tariff_found}

Without Electricity Tariffs the conductor installs but does not drive anything: it needs prices and off-peak hours ({tariff_url}). Everything else (subscribed power, offer, prices, off-peak hours, battery modes and SOC) is read from these integrations: nothing to enter again.

